<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>Pendaftaran Dikirim - FoodLink</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Nunito:wght@400;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary: #79b549;
            --text: #2f332c;
            --muted: #767c73;
            --bg: #f6f8f2;
            --warn-soft: #fdeede;
            --warn: #b25800;
            --badge-bg: #fdecc8;
            --badge-text: #a86400;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            min-height: 100vh;
            background-color: var(--bg);
            color: var(--text);
            font-family: 'Nunito', system-ui, sans-serif;
            font-size: 15px;
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        }

        .wrap {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 520px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 98px 20px 72px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .ikon {
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            width: 122px;
            height: 122px;
            margin: 0 auto 26px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background-color: var(--warn-soft);
            color: var(--warn);
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 30px;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: -0.4px;
        }

        .badge {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 14px;
            padding: 5px 14px;
            border-radius: 99px;
            background-color: var(--badge-bg);
            color: var(--badge-text);
            font-size: 12.5px;
            font-weight: 800;
        }

        p {
            margin: 18px 0 26px;
            color: var(--muted);
            line-height: 1.55;
        }

        .btn {
            display: block;
            width: 100%;
            padding: 15px 24px;
            border: 0;
            border-radius: 14px;
            background-color: var(--primary);
            color: #ffffff;
            font: inherit;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 800;
            text-align: center;
            text-decoration: none;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .btn:hover {
            filter: brightness(0.95);
        }

        .btn:focus-visible {
            outline: 3px solid rgba(121, 181, 73, 0.35);
            outline-offset: 2px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 560px) {
            .wrap {
                padding: 56px 18px 48px;
            }

            h1 {
                font-size: 25px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <main class="wrap">
        <div class="ikon">
            <svg width="52" height="52" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                 stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/>
                <path d="M12 7v5l3 2"/>
            </svg>
        </div>

        <h1>Pendaftaran Dikirim</h1>
        <span class="badge">Menunggu Verifikasi</span>
        <p>Admin FoodLink sedang memeriksa dokumen Anda. Anda akan melihat hasilnya di halaman
           status setelah verifikasi selesai.</p>

        <a class="btn" href="/">Kembali ke Beranda</a>
    </main>
</body>
</html>